OL,3,GNEWSASerial rapist jailed for attacks
OL,4,Ain five countries over 16-year period
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial rapist who carried out sexual
OL,7,Foffences against victims in Scotland
OL,8,Fand abroad has been jailed for 17
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FAaron Stewart, 48, targeted women in
OL,12,FGlasgow and Edinburgh as well as
OL,13,Flocations in Spain, Morocco, Mexico and
OL,14,FPoland.
OL,16,FThe High Court in Edinburgh heard that
OL,17,Fhe subjected victims to rape, sexual
OL,18,Fassault and abuse between 2008 and
OL,19,F2024.
